enum sovcommon.ui.Tone codes=- jsonCodes=false ordered=false defines="" doc="A semantic or qualitative colour slot. Each one resolves to a --color-* token that\ntokens.css defines for dark and light, with its -soft background. No colour value\nlives in config.\n\nSemantic tones are reserved for meaning (status, severity, flags, intent).\nQualitative series slots tell families apart, always together with icon + label."
